# AI Translated
msgid "Ironing temperature"
msgstr "Teocht iarnála"

# AI Translated
msgid ""
"Nozzle temperature while this filament irons. The nozzle goes back to the "
"print temperature once ironing is done. 0 means no change."
msgstr ""
"Teocht an tsoic fad a iarnálann an filiméad seo. Filleann an soc ar an "
"teocht phriontála nuair a bhíonn an iarnáil críochnaithe. Ciallaíonn 0 gan "
"athrú."
